# Breakout: Braille ball trail, paddle glow and flash, exploding bricks.
Output docs/breakout.gif
Source scripts/vhs/_common.tape

Hide
Type "./target/release/termplay game breakout"
Enter
Sleep 1s
Show

Sleep 500ms
# Launch the ball, then sweep the paddle to keep it in play
Space
Sleep 1500ms
Right 6
Sleep 700ms
Left 12
Sleep 700ms
Right 14
Sleep 700ms
Left 10
Sleep 700ms
Right 8
Sleep 700ms
Left 12
Sleep 700ms
Right 10
Sleep 2s

Type "q"
Sleep 500ms
